   (ESE 2016)},
Year = {2016},
Pages = {909-914},
Note = {International Conference on Environmental Science and Engineering (ESE),
   Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 15-17, 2016},
Abstract = {The methods and theory of the location of environmental emergency
   supplies library system have important theoretical and practical
   significance to the current frequent occurrence of sudden emergency
   environmental pollution incidents. On account of limitations and
   applicability of the Location theory of existing emergency supplies
   libraries, this article established environmental emergency risk source
   assessment and emergency supplies libraries location system models based
   on AHP-TOPSIS. First, based on the Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) to
   establish the risk source identification and assessment model, the
   article determine the risk level of each risk sources. Secondly, carry
   out the basic idea based on TOPSIS method, establish the emergency
   supplies libraries optimization model, to evaluate and screen the
   complex factors alternative materials library and find the best
   emergency supplies bank address. Finally, the case study results show
   the effectiveness of this method in the library location of emergency
   supplies, meanwhile providing fast and effective technical support for
   the dispatch of emergency supplies.},
