Pages = {2547-2552},
Note = {International Conference on Energy and Environmental Science (ICEES),
   Singapore, SINGAPORE, OCT, 2011},
Organization = {Singapore Inst Elect (SIE)},
Abstract = {In China, the scale livestock plants are developing very fast at
   present. It has resulted serious environmental pollution problems. The
   aim of this study is to provide technical methods how to treat and
   manage livestock manure produced in the scale culture plant. Authors
   collected a large of literature about livestock manure. The status of
   the livestock culture scale and its pollution in China were summarized
   at first. Livestock manure is a sort of valuable resource according to
   its chemical composition. Biogas technology, used to treat livestock
   manure, can save energy and reduce carbon emission. Biogas is a
   renewable energy. Biogas residue is a kind of high quality organic
   fertilizer. So, the popular anaerobic processes about animal manure
   treating were summarized in the paper. They are anaerobic contact
   process (ACP), the Up flow anaerobic sludge blanket (UASB), and upflow
   solid reactor (USR). Some engineering cases of these technologies also
   were provided. In the end, technology and method of preventing livestock
   manure pollution were forecasted. (C) 2011 Published by Elsevier Ltd.
   Selection and/or peer-review under responsibility of the Organizers of
   2011 International Conference on Energy and Environmental Science.},
