Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {This paper investigates the relationship between coal consumption and
   real GDP from a perspective of business cycle, during which the
   empirical work is conducted by employing the methods of grey correlation
   analysis, elastic coefficient of coal consumption and the econometric
   model for energy efficiency. The preliminary conclusions indicate that:
   during the different economic cycle, energy species which has the most
   contribution to national economy growth experiences the change of
   `coal-oil-coal'; the economic growth pattern exists the essential
   difference of intensive or extensive style owning to the adjustment of
   industrial structure, the change of energy structure and the improvement
   of coal efficiency; the overheated economy is universally accompanied by
   the mass utilization of coal.},
