   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {This study examines the garden spaces of buildings in China's Chengde
   Mountain Resort. Based on a literature study and field survey, we sorted
   out and analyzed the functions, building quantities, types, and methods
   for composing 142 groups of garden spaces. We concluded that the garden
   space within the resort could be divided into 6 types and 97 models of
   space composition. Additionally, we found that the performance and
   characteristics of a garden space are related closely to the personality
   attributes and behavioral patterns of its users (e.g., original owner).},
